{"search_note":"I did not find strong 2024 evidence of routine public-service measurement systems, dashboards, KPI publication, independent audits, or transparent scorecards for health, education, water, sanitation, or social protection.

The best evidence is indirect and partial: IMF program design, technocratic staffing, energy-contract correction, and one reactive prison-health fix after reporting.

That means the answer is not “clear yes”; it is “some evidence of correction, but limited proof of a durable measurement-and-transparency regime.”","evidence":[{"title":"Pakistan: IMF Reaches Agreement on Economic Policies for 37-month EFF","publisher":"IMF","date":"2024-07-12","url":"https://www.imf.org/en/news/articles/2024/07/12/pr-24273-pakistan-imf-reaches-agreement-on-economic-policies-for-37-month-eff","summary":"The new program tied policy to diagnosis and correction: broaden the tax base, improve SOE management, strengthen competition, and expand BISP plus health and education spending. This is the strongest evidence that Sharif’s team used externally supplied analysis to redirect service-related policy.","question_ids":["6B.5","6B.2","6B.4","5B.7"]},{"title":"PM to choose banker Aurangzeb as finance minister, sources say","publisher":"Reuters via ThePrint","date":"2024-03-11","url":"https://theprint.in/world/pakistan-pm-to-choose-banker-aurangzeb-as-finance-minister-sources-say/1996592/","summary":"Sharif chose a career banker for finance rather than a purely political loyalist, which is evidence for technocratic, competence-seeking management rather than patronage alone.","question_ids":["6B.5","6B.4","5B.7"]},{"title":"PM forms new Economic Advisory Council without Dar, Aurangzeb","publisher":"The News","date":"2024-05-19","url":"https://www.thenews.com.pk/print/1190715-pm-forms-new-economic-advisory-council-without-dar-aurangzeb","summary":"Sharif created a council of economists, technocrats, and business figures to guide policy, which suggests some reliance on expertise and external advice for course correction.","question_ids":["6B.5","6B.4","5B.7"]},{"title":"Pakistan renegotiating power deals to cut costs, minister says","publisher":"Reuters via Dawn","date":"2024-10-10","url":"https://www.dawn.com/news/amp/1864298","summary":"The government renegotiated costly power-purchase contracts to lower tariffs and save about Rs60 billion a year, a concrete example of corrective action based on cost evidence and household pressure.","question_ids":["6B.5","6B.2","5B.9","5B.10"]},{"title":"World Report 2024: Pakistan","publisher":"Human Rights Watch","date":"2024","url":"https://www.hrw.org/world-report/2024/country-chapters/pakistan","summary":"After HRW reporting on prison health, Sharif ordered sanitation and healthcare measures in Lahore Central Prison and promised prison reforms, which is a narrow but real example of reacting to evidence with operational correction.","question_ids":["6B.5","6B.1","6B.2"]},{"title":"Sharif personally took charge of ECNEC instead of letting finance minister Aurangzeb chair it","publisher":"Dawn","date":"2024-06-15","url":"https://www.dawn.com/news/1839967","summary":"Sharif retained direct control over a key economic coordination body rather than fully delegating to the technocratic finance minister, which weakens the case for a sustained technocratic, measurement-led management style.","question_ids":["6B.5","6B.4"]},{"title":"Pakistan 2024 Article IV Consultation and Request for an Extended Arrangement under the EFF","publisher":"IMF","date":"2024-10-10","url":"https://www.imf.org/en/publications/cr/issues/2024/10/10/pakistan-2024-article-iv-consultation-and-request-for-an-extended-arrangement-under-the-556152","summary":"The IMF still described weak governance, a narrow tax base, very low investment, and insufficient health and education spending, which means the correction agenda was real but still incomplete and not yet fully reflected in service delivery.","question_ids":["6B.5","5B.10","6B.2"]}]}
